#: mod/factionInfo.lua:1
msgid "Independent"
msgstr "Unabhängige"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:3
msgid ""
"Despite appearing as a faction, independents are distinguished primarily by "
"having no strong affiliation with any faction at all. Most traders consider "
"themselves independent, though certain voices have started to speak up about "
"creating a merchant faction."
msgstr "Unabhängige Schiffe, die keiner Fraktion angehören."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:12
msgid "Escort craft from Endor"
msgstr "Eskortenschiffe von Endor"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:18
msgid "Raiders that may attack you."
msgstr "Banditen, die möglicherweise angreifen."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:31
msgid "Infrastructure around Endor"
msgstr "Infrastruktur um Endor"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:36
msgid "Debris flying around. Or stuff that you can make to debris..."
msgstr ""
"Herumfliegende Trümmer. Oder Dinge, die zu herumfliegenden Trümmern gemacht "
"werden können."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:42 mod/factionInfo.lua:83
msgid "Criminals"
msgstr "Kriminelle"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:44 mod/factionInfo.lua:85
msgid ""
"Despite appearing as a faction, criminals are distinguished primarily by "
"having no strong affiliation with any faction at all. Pirates, outlaws and "
"fugitives are considered criminals."
msgstr ""
"Piraten, Gesetzesbrecher und Flüchtlinge, die allesamt als Kriminelle "
"gesehen werden."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:56
msgid "Remnants of the Imperial Forces"
msgstr "Überreste der Imperialen Streitkräfte"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:62
msgid "The New Republic"
msgstr "Die Neue Republik"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:106
msgid "A TIE pilot drifting around in space."
msgstr ""

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:133
msgid "Transport"
msgstr "Transporter"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:133
msgid "Transport craft from Endor"
msgstr "Transportschiffe von Endor"

